  "extractionNotes": "Stillbirth on 2025-05-12, proven by a birth-act extract with the stillbirth annotation. ZAM claims maternity 2025-05-12..2025-07-06 only, with no parental leave. The ZUS register shows the Maly ZUS Plus title (0590) from 2023-01-01 with voluntary sickness insurance until 2025-05-11 and the benefit-period variant (0590T) 2025-05-12..2025-07-06, confirmed 2025-06-06; the benefit-period variant and its end are not modelled (the sickness period is left open, as in the pilots). A letter register lists a granting decision dated 2025-06-12; its text is not in the file, so the period is taken from the benefit-period title row. Rate not printed (100% for stillbirth inferred). Declared bases not in the file. A marriage-certificate extract was filed but is not needed."
